Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.64,0:00:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A place for the tainted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing but a sound
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I try to be frank with you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.76,0:00:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but words won't leave my mouth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd lie if I could take little more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I resting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Some day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a point of break where I will beg me to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.94,0:00:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where I was before my feet kept missing the brakes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousand miles an hour, I come back home and I fade
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,(fade)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a stone that's crushing me on top of my chest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.66,0:00:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray for peace e- every time I walk to my bed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh how I wish to tell you something worth your time here with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,already breaking as the person that I'm trying to be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.90,0:00:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For every time I forced myself to push through my bounds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.58,0:01:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear a cry, a child in me, that wants to be proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it's love until I realized it's hate in disguise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.12,0:01:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate myself for times I wasn't able making it right
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,ooh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.32,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I take the pain and lock it deeply
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.14,0:01:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I deserve it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.22,0:01:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I take my shame and lock it deeply
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I deserve it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I take the stress and lock it deeply
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.68,0:01:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I deserve it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.64,0:01:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I took my state and kept it in me
